#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:2
msgid "Quick reference for regexp syntax"
msgstr "Rýchla referencia syntaxe regulárnych výrazov"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:4
msgid ""
"This checklist summarizes the most commonly used/hard to remember parts of "
"the regexp engine available in most parts of calibre."
msgstr ""
"Tento kontrolný zoznam zhrňuje najčastejšie používané a ťažko zapamätateľné "
"časti engine-u regulárnych výrazov dostupného vo väčšine častí calibre."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:10
msgid "Contents"
msgstr "Obsah"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:13
msgid "Character classes"
msgstr "Triedy znakov"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:15
msgid ""
"Character classes are useful to represent different groups of characters, "
"succinctly."
msgstr ""
"Triedy znakov sú užitočné na stručné vyjadrenie rôznych skupín znakov."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:18
msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "Príklady:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:21
#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:52
#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:241
#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:271
msgid "**Representation**"
msgstr "**Reprezentácia**"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:21
#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:52
msgid "**Class**"
msgstr "**Trieda**"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:24
msgid "``[a-z]``"
msgstr "``[a-z]``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:24
msgid ""
"Lowercase letters. Does not include characters with accent mark and "
"ligatures"
msgstr "Malé písmená. Nezahŕňa znaky s diakritikou a ligatúry"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:27
msgid "``[a-z0-9]``"
msgstr "``[a-z0-9]``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:27
msgid "Lowercase letters from a to z or numbers from 0 to 9"
msgstr "Malé písmená od a do z alebo čísla od 0 do 9"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:29
msgid "``[A-Za-z-]``"
msgstr "``[A-Za-z-]``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:29
msgid ""
"Uppercase or lowercase letters, or a dash. To include the dash in a class, "
"you must put it at the beginning or at the end so as not to confuse it with "
"the hyphen that specifies a range of characters"
msgstr ""
"Veľké alebo malé písmená, alebo pomlčka. Ak chcete pomlčku zahrnúť do "
"triedy, musíte ju umiestniť na začiatok alebo na koniec, aby sa nezamieňala "
"so spojovníkom, ktorý určuje rozsah znakov"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:33
msgid "``[^0-9]``"
msgstr "``[^0-9]``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:33
msgid ""
"Any character except a digit. The caret (^) placed at the beginning of the "
"class excludes the characters of the class (complemented class)"
msgstr ""
"Akýkoľvek znak okrem číslice. Znak ^ umiestnený na začiatku triedy vylučuje "
"znaky triedy (doplnená trieda)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:36
msgid "``[[a-z]--[aeiouy]]``"
msgstr "``[[a-z]--[aeiouy]]``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:36
msgid ""
"The lowercase consonants. A class can be included in a class. The characters"
" ``--`` exclude what follows them"
msgstr ""
"Malé spoluhlásky. Trieda môže byť vložená do triedy. Znaky ``--`` vylučujú "
"to, čo po nich nasleduje"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:39
msgid "``[\\w--[\\d_]]``"
msgstr "``[\\w--[\\d_]]``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:39
msgid ""
"All letters (including foreign accented characters). Abbreviated classes can"
" be used inside a class"
msgstr ""
"Všetky písmená (vrátane cudzích znakov s diakritikou). Skrátené triedy možno"
" použiť vnútri triedy"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:44
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Príklad::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:49
msgid "Shorthand character classes"
msgstr "Skrátené triedy znakov"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:55
msgid "``\\d``"
msgstr "``\\d``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:55
msgid "A digit (same as ``[0-9]``)"
msgstr "Číslica (rovnaké ako ``[0-9]``)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:57
msgid "``\\D``"
msgstr "``\\D``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:57
msgid "Any non-numeric character (same as ``[^0-9]``)"
msgstr "Akýkoľvek nečíselný znak (rovnaké ako ``[^0-9]``)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:59
msgid "``\\w``"
msgstr "``\\w``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:59
msgid ""
"An alphanumeric character (``[a-zA-Z0-9]``) including characters with accent"
" mark and ligatures"
msgstr ""
"Alfanumerický znak (``[a-zA-Z0-9]``) vrátane znakov s diakritikou a ligatúr"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:62
msgid "``\\W``"
msgstr "``\\W``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:62
msgid "Any “non-word” character"
msgstr "Akýkoľvek „neznakový“ znak"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:64
msgid "``\\s``"
msgstr "``\\s``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:64
msgid "Space, non-breaking space, tab, carriage return"
msgstr "Medzera, pevná medzera, tabulátor, návrat vozíka"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:66
msgid "``\\S``"
msgstr "``\\S``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:66
msgid "Any “non-whitespace” character"
msgstr "Akýkoľvek „nebiely“ znak"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:68
msgid "``.``"
msgstr "``.``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:68
msgid ""
"Any character except newline. Use the “dot all” checkbox or the ``(?s)`` "
"regexp modifier to include the newline character."
msgstr ""
"Akýkoľvek znak okrem zalomenia riadku. Ak chcete zahrnúť aj znak zalomenia "
"riadku, použite zaškrtávacie políčko „dot all“ alebo modifikátor regulárneho"
" výrazu ``(?s)``."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:73
msgid "The quantifiers"
msgstr "Kvantifikátory"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:76
msgid "**Quantifier**"
msgstr "**Kvantifikátor**"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:76
msgid "**Number of occurrences of the expression preceding the quantifier**"
msgstr "**Počet výskytov výrazu predchádzajúceho kvantifikátoru**"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:79
msgid "``?``"
msgstr "``?``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:79
msgid "0 or 1 occurrence of the expression. Same as ``{0,1}``"
msgstr "0 alebo 1 výskyt výrazu. Rovnaké ako ``{0,1}``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:81
msgid "``+``"
msgstr "``+``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:81
msgid "1 or more occurrences of the expression. Same as ``{1,}``"
msgstr "1 alebo viac výskytov výrazu. Rovnaké ako ``{1,}``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:83
msgid "``*``"
msgstr "``*``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:83
msgid "0, 1 or more occurrences of the expression. Same as ``{0,}``"
msgstr "0, 1 alebo viac výskytov výrazu. Rovnaké ako ``{0,}``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:85
msgid "``{n}``"
msgstr "``{n}``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:85
msgid "Exactly n occurrences of the expression"
msgstr "Presne n výskytov výrazu"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:87
msgid "``{min,max}``"
msgstr "``{min,max}``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:87
msgid "Number of occurrences between the minimum and maximum values included"
msgstr "Počet výskytov medzi minimálnou a maximálnou hodnotou vrátane"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:89
msgid "``{min,}``"
msgstr "``{min,}``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:89
msgid "Number of occurrences between the minimum value included and infinity"
msgstr "Počet výskytov medzi minimálnou hodnotou vrátane a nekonečnom"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:91
msgid "``{,max}``"
msgstr "``{,max}``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:91
msgid "Number of occurrences between 0 and the maximum value included"
msgstr "Počet výskytov medzi 0 a maximálnou hodnotou vrátane"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:97
msgid "Greed"
msgstr "Nenásytnosť"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:99
msgid ""
"By default, with quantifiers, the regular expression engine is greedy: it "
"extends the selection as much as possible. This often causes surprises, at "
"first. ``?`` follows a quantifier to make it lazy. Avoid putting two in the "
"same expression, the result can be unpredictable."
msgstr ""
"V predvolenom nastavení je engine regulárnych výrazov pri kvantifikátoroch "
"nenásytný: rozširuje výber čo najviac. To spočiatku často prekvapí. Znak "
"``?`` za kvantifikátorom ho robí lenivým. Vyhnite sa dvom v jednom výraze, "
"výsledok môže byť nepredvídateľný."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:104
msgid ""
"Beware of nesting quantifiers, for example, the pattern ``(a*)*``, as it "
"exponentially increases processing time."
msgstr ""
"Dávajte pozor na vnorené kvantifikátory, napríklad vzor ``(a*)*``, pretože "
"exponenciálne zvyšujú čas spracovania."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:108
msgid "Alternation"
msgstr "Alternácia"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:110
msgid ""
"The ``|`` character in a regular expression is a logical ``OR``. It means "
"that either the preceding or the following expression can match."
msgstr ""
"Znak ``|`` v regulárnom výraze je logické ``OR``. Znamená, že sa môže "
"zhodovať buď predchádzajúci, alebo nasledujúci výraz."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:114
msgid "Exclusion"
msgstr "Vylúčenie"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:116
msgid "Method 1"
msgstr "Metóda 1"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:118
msgid "``pattern_to_exclude(*SKIP)(*FAIL)|pattern_to_select``"
msgstr "``pattern_to_exclude(*SKIP)(*FAIL)|pattern_to_select``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:120
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "Príklad:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:122
msgid "``\"Blabla\"(*SKIP)(*FAIL)|Blabla``"
msgstr "``\"Blabla\"(*SKIP)(*FAIL)|Blabla``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:124
#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:132
msgid ""
"selects Blabla, in the strings Blabla or \"Blabla or Blabla\", but not in "
"\"Blabla\"."
msgstr ""
"vyberie Blabla v reťazcoch Blabla alebo \"Blabla or Blabla\", ale nie v "
"\"Blabla\"."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:126
msgid "Method 2"
msgstr "Metóda 2"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:128
msgid "``pattern_to_exclude\\K|(pattern_to_select)``"
msgstr "``pattern_to_exclude\\K|(pattern_to_select)``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:130
msgid "``\"Blabla\"\\K|(Blabla)``"
msgstr "``\"Blabla\"\\K|(Blabla)``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:135
msgid "Anchors"
msgstr "Kotvy"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:137
msgid ""
"An anchor is a way to match a logical location in a string, rather than a "
"character. The most useful anchors for text processing are:"
msgstr ""
"Kotva je spôsob, ako sa zhodovať s logickým miestom v reťazci namiesto "
"znaku. Najužitočnejšie kotvy na spracovanie textu sú:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:140
msgid "``\\b``"
msgstr "``\\b``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:141
msgid ""
"Designates a word boundary, i.e. a transition from space to non-space "
"character. For example, you can use ``\\bsurd`` to match ``the surd`` but "
"not ``absurd``."
msgstr ""
"Označuje hranicu slova, t. j. prechod z medzery na znak, ktorý nie je "
"medzera. Napríklad ``\\bsurd`` môžete použiť na zhodu s ``the surd``, ale "
"nie s ``absurd``."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:145
msgid "``^``"
msgstr "``^``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:146
msgid "Matches the start of a line (in multi-line mode, which is the default)"
msgstr ""
"Zodpovedá začiatku riadka (v režime viacerých riadkov, čo je predvolené)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:149
msgid "``$``"
msgstr "``$``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:150
msgid "Matches the end of a line (in multi-line mode, which is the default)"
msgstr "Zodpovedá koncu riadka (v režime viacerých riadkov, čo je predvolené)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:152
msgid "``\\K``"
msgstr "``\\K``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:153
msgid ""
"Resets the start position of the selection to its position in the pattern. "
"Some regexp engines (but not calibre) do not allow lookbehind of variable "
"length, especially with quantifiers. When you can use ``\\K`` with these "
"engines, it also allows you to get rid of this limit by writing the "
"equivalent of a positive lookbehind of variable length."
msgstr ""
"Obnoví počiatočnú pozíciu výberu na jeho pozíciu vo vzore. Niektoré engine-y"
" regulárnych výrazov (ale nie calibre) nepovoľujú lookbehind s premenlivou "
"dĺžkou, najmä s kvantifikátormi. Ak môžete ``\\K`` použiť s týmito engine-"
"mi, umožní vám to tiež zbaviť sa tohto obmedzenia napísaním ekvivalentu "
"pozitívneho lookbehind-u s premenlivou dĺžkou."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:160
msgid "Groups"
msgstr "Skupiny"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:162
msgid "``(expression)``"
msgstr "``(expression)``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:163
msgid ""
"Capturing group, which stores the selection and can be recalled later in the"
" *search* or *replace* patterns with ``\\n``, where ``n`` is the sequence "
"number of the capturing group (starting at 1 in reading order)"
msgstr ""
"Zachytávajúca skupina, ktorá ukladá výber a môže sa neskôr vyvolať vo "
"vzoroch *hľadania* alebo *nahrádzania* pomocou ``\\n``, kde ``n`` je "
"poradové číslo zachytávajúcej skupiny (začína sa na 1 v poradí čítania)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:167
msgid "``(?:expression)``"
msgstr "``(?:expression)``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:168
msgid "Group that does not capture the selection"
msgstr "Skupina, ktorá nezachytáva výber"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:170
msgid "``(?>expression)``"
msgstr "``(?>expression)``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:171
msgid ""
"Atomic Group: As soon as the expression is satisfied, the regexp engine "
"passes, and if the rest of the pattern fails, it will not backtrack to try "
"other combinations with the expression. Atomic groups do not capture."
msgstr ""
"Atomická skupina: Len čo je výraz splnený, engine regulárnych výrazov "
"postúpi ďalej, a ak zvyšok vzoru zlyhá, nevráti sa späť, aby vyskúšal iné "
"kombinácie s výrazom. Atomické skupiny nezachytávajú."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:176
msgid "``(?|expression)``"
msgstr "``(?|expression)``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:177
msgid ""
"Branch reset group: the branches of the alternations included in the "
"expression share the same group numbers"
msgstr ""
"Skupina s resetom vetvy: vetvy alternácií zahrnuté vo výraze zdieľajú "
"rovnaké čísla skupín"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:180
msgid "``(?<name>expression)``"
msgstr "``(?<name>expression)``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:181
msgid ""
"Group named “name”. The selection can be recalled later in the *search* "
"pattern by ``(?P=name)`` and in the *replace* by ``\\g<name>``. Two "
"different groups can use the same name."
msgstr ""
"Skupina s názvom „name“. Výber možno neskôr vyvolať vo vzore *hľadania* "
"pomocou ``(?P=name)`` a v *nahrádzaní* pomocou ``\\g<name>``. Dve rôzne "
"skupiny môžu použiť rovnaký názov."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:187
msgid "Lookarounds"
msgstr "Lookaround-y"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:190
msgid "**Lookaround**"
msgstr "**Lookaround**"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:190
#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:241
msgid "**Meaning**"
msgstr "**Význam**"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:193
msgid "``?=``"
msgstr "``?=``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:193
msgid "Positive lookahead (to be placed after the selection)"
msgstr "Pozitívny lookahead (umiestňuje sa za výber)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:196
msgid "``?!``"
msgstr "``?!``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:196
msgid "Negative lookahead (to be placed after the selection)"
msgstr "Negatívny lookahead (umiestňuje sa za výber)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:199
msgid "``?<=``"
msgstr "``?<=``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:199
msgid "Positive lookbehind (to be placed before the selection)"
msgstr "Pozitívny lookbehind (umiestňuje sa pred výber)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:202
msgid "``?<!``"
msgstr "``?<!``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:202
msgid "Negative lookbehind (to be placed before the selection)"
msgstr "Negatívny lookbehind (umiestňuje sa pred výber)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:206
msgid ""
"Lookaheads and lookbehinds do not consume characters, they are zero length "
"and do not capture. They are atomic groups: as soon as the assertion is "
"satisfied, the regexp engine passes, and if the rest of the pattern fails, "
"it will not backtrack inside the lookaround to try other combinations."
msgstr ""
"Lookahead-y a lookbehind-y nespotrebúvajú znaky, majú nulovú dĺžku a "
"nezachytávajú. Sú to atomické skupiny: len čo je tvrdenie splnené, engine "
"regulárnych výrazov postúpi ďalej, a ak zvyšok vzoru zlyhá, nevráti sa späť "
"do lookaround-u, aby vyskúšal iné kombinácie."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:211
msgid ""
"When looking for multiple matches in a string, at the starting position of "
"each match attempt, a lookbehind can inspect the characters before the "
"current position. Therefore, on the string 123, the pattern ``(?<=\\d)\\d`` "
"(a digit preceded by a digit) should, in theory, select 2 and 3. On the "
"other hand, ``\\d\\K\\d`` can only select 2, because the starting position "
"after the first selection is immediately before 3, and there are not enough "
"digits for a second match. Similarly, ``\\d(\\d)`` only captures 2. In "
"calibre's regexp engine practice, the positive lookbehind behaves in the "
"same way, and selects only 2, contrary to theory."
msgstr ""
"Pri hľadaní viacerých zhôd v reťazci môže lookbehind na počiatočnej pozícii "
"každého pokusu o zhodu preskúmať znaky pred aktuálnou pozíciou. Preto by v "
"reťazci 123 mal vzor ``(?<=\\d)\\d`` (číslica predchádzaná číslicou) "
"teoreticky vybrať 2 a 3. Na druhej strane ``\\d\\K\\d`` môže vybrať iba 2, "
"pretože počiatočná pozícia po prvom výbere je bezprostredne pred 3 a na "
"druhú zhodu nie je dostatok číslic. Podobne ``\\d(\\d)`` zachytáva iba 2. V "
"praxi engine-u regulárnych výrazov calibre sa pozitívny lookbehind správa "
"rovnako a vyberie iba 2, na rozdiel od teórie."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:221
msgid ""
"Groups can be placed inside lookarounds, but capture is rarely useful. "
"Nevertheless, if it is useful, it will be necessary to be very careful in "
"the use of a quantifier in a lookbehind: the greed associated with the "
"absence of backtracking can give a surprising capture. For this reason, use "
"``\\K`` rather than a positive lookbehind when you have a quantifier (or "
"worse, several) in a capturing group of the positive lookbehind."
msgstr ""
"Skupiny možno umiestniť do lookaround-ov, ale zachytávanie je zriedka "
"užitočné. Ak je však užitočné, bude potrebné byť veľmi opatrný pri použití "
"kvantifikátora v lookbehind-e: nenásytnosť spojená s absenciou "
"backtracking-u môže priniesť prekvapivé zachytenie. Z tohto dôvodu použite "
"radšej ``\\K`` než pozitívny lookbehind, ak máte kvantifikátor (alebo "
"horšie, niekoľko) v zachytávajúcej skupine pozitívneho lookbehind-u."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:228
msgid "Example of negative lookahead:"
msgstr "Príklad negatívneho lookahead-u:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:230
msgid "``(?![^<>{}]*[>}])``"
msgstr "``(?![^<>{}]*[>}])``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:232
msgid ""
"Placed at the end of the pattern prevents selecting within a tag or a style "
"embedded in the file."
msgstr ""
"Umiestnený na konci vzoru zabraňuje výberu vnútri značky alebo štýlu "
"vloženého v súbore."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:234
msgid ""
"Whenever possible, it is always better to \"anchor\" the lookarounds, to "
"reduce the number of steps necessary to obtain the result."
msgstr ""
"Kedykoľvek je to možné, je vždy lepšie lookaround-y „zakotviť“, aby sa "
"znížil počet krokov potrebných na dosiahnutie výsledku."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:238
msgid "Recursion"
msgstr "Rekurzia"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:244
msgid "``(?R)``"
msgstr "``(?R)``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/regexp_quick_reference.rst:244
msgid "Recursion of the entire pattern"
msgstr "Rekurzia celého vzoru"

